                                                "example_id": "3182bb4b-68ab-414f-a49d-5815db29b46f",
                                                "sense_id": "96af806f-664f-321e-ba87-8b1c106cadba",
                                                "text": "My head was swimming after drinking two bottles of cheap wine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "149afb1f-9bd5-48c1-af7f-ac182158769f",
                                                "sense_id": "96af806f-664f-321e-ba87-8b1c106cadba",
                                                "text": "She snatched the letter from Sir Jasper, who started as her icy hand touched his: she attempted to read the passage herself, but the letters seemed to swim before her gaze: they turned to fire; the paper dropped from her grasp; a thick mist appeared to gather over the room; she gave a convulsive shudder, and dropped on the floor perfectly insensible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
